Yep, try the patch below.


Takashi

diff -r 821d98a655de aplay/aplay.c
--- a/aplay/aplay.c	Thu Jul 27 11:02:00 2006 +0200
+++ b/aplay/aplay.c	Thu Aug 03 17:21:25 2006 +0200
